**先計算 7 的階乘**

```json
{
  "name": "math_factorial",
  "arguments": {
    "number": 7
  }
}
```

**再尋找符合條件的長笛**

```json
{
  "name": "find_flute",
  "arguments": {
    "brand": "Yamaha",
    "specs": ["open hole", "silver headjoint"]
  }
}
```

**最後計算顯性等位基因頻率為 0.6 時，AA 基因型的頻率**

```json
{
  "name": "calculate_genotype_frequency",
  "arguments": {
    "allele_frequency": 0.6,
    "genotype": "AA"
  }
}
```
